# Storage-only Pausable component.
#
# This component installs the `is_paused` storage slot. It does not expose any
# authorization-sensitive procedures: `pause` and `unpause` are gated and exposed
# by wrapper components such as `pausable_owner` (Ownable2Step-gated) or
# `pausable_rbac` (role-gated), which compose the underlying `exec.pausable::*`
# helpers from `miden::standards::utils::pausable`.
#
# As a read-only convenience this component re-exports `is_paused` (no auth needed).
# Downstream components that need to gate logic on pause state (e.g. asset callbacks)
# should call `exec.::miden::standards::utils::pausable::assert_not_paused` directly.

pub use ::miden::standards::utils::pausable::is_paused
